SUMMARY:Cognitive Neuroscience Society Annual Meeting 2027
DESCRIPTION:The Cognitive Neuroscience Society holds its annual meeting o
 n the biological basis of mind in Boston\, Massachusetts. The program in
 cludes invited symposia\, poster sessions and the society's career and y
 oung investigator award lectures.\n\nDeadlines\nSubmissions open: 2026-0
 9-01\nSymposium proposal submission: 2026-09-14\nAward nomination (Georg
 e A. Miller and Distinguished Career Contributions): 2026-09-25\nAward n
 omination (Young Investigator): 2026-10-02\nTravel award application ope
 ns: 2026-10-05\nRegistration opens: 2026-10-23\nAbstract submission (pos
 ter): 2026-11-03\nTravel award application deadline: 2026-11-03\nLate-br
 eaking abstract submission: 2027-01-19\nEarly registration: 2027-01-05\n
 Hotel reservation deadline: 2027-02-24\n\nhttps://www.cogneurosociety.or
 g/annual-meeting/
LOCATION:Boston\, Massachusetts
URL:https://www.cogneurosociety.org/annual-meeting/
